1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,247
I started contacting
customers before my tools

2
00:00:03,335 --> 00:00:04,016
were ready.

3
00:00:04,037 --> 00:00:05,770
Not because I was
confident.

4
00:00:05,823 --> 00:00:08,732
Because every week I
waited, I learned nothing.

5
00:00:08,822 --> 00:00:11,546
So I picked a small
group of real people and

6
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:13,053
sent the first message.

7
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,132
Then I built the tool to
keep track of it.

8
00:00:19,213 --> 00:00:20,017
A to-do list.

9
00:00:20,042 --> 00:00:21,094
A follow-up date.

10
00:00:21,127 --> 00:00:23,355
A place to write down
what happened.

11
00:00:23,424 --> 00:00:25,961
You don't need the
perfect plan to start.

12
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,835
You need the next small
step,

13
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:30,180
and somewhere to record
what happens.

14
00:00:30,251 --> 00:00:30,932
I'm Andrew.

15
00:00:30,953 --> 00:00:33,676
I'm building a business,
and the software to

16
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,256
run it.

17
00:00:34,271 --> 00:00:35,075
Follow along.

